Package: sapid
Title: A Strategy to Analyze Plant Extracts Taste in Depth
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Adriano",
           family = "Rutz",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "adafede@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0443-9902"))
Description: Provides the infrastructure to implement a Strategy to Analyze
    Plant Extracts Taste In Depth (SAPID) by combining sensory panel profiling,
    projective napping, and Ascending Forced Choice (AFC) threshold testing
    with untargeted LC-MS feature tables, Charged Aerosol Detection (CAD)
    semi-quantification, taxonomically informed metabolite annotations (TIMA),
    and 1D proton NMR spectral clustering.
